OL,5,G0532 Inheritance
OL,6,     F5/10. Fiat's business booms in
OL,7,     Fpost-war Italy. But just after
OL,8,     FGianni finally takes charge,
OL,9,     Fworker unrest threatens to throw
OL,10,     Fthe industrial giant into chaos.
